    "title": "Body found in Salem Harbor awaiting identification - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sophia Harris ,\n10 hours ago SALEM — Salem police are investigating after a body was recovered from the water near Central Wharf Tuesday morning. Police said officers were notified at approximately 9:40 a.m. that a body was floating in the area. The victim has not yet been identified, and the cause of death remains under investigation. Read full article",
